OL,3,GNEWSAThe author unearthing the past in
OL,4,Ahis local graveyards
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen looking for a way to brighten up
OL,7,Fyour day, not many would head for the
OL,8,Fgraveyard.
OL,10,FFor Wigtown bookshop owner and author
OL,11,FBre Martin, however, there is no better
OL,12,Fplace to spend your time.
OL,14,FHe has made it his mission to record
OL,15,Fthe names, inscriptions and epitaphs on
OL,16,Fthe headstones of Galloway before they
OL,17,Fcrumble into dust, as well as
OL,18,Fresearching the stories of the people
OL,19,Fburied underneath.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
